  sub: 'This is a first-principles curriculum rebuilt as a mission. Learn the relational model <b>deeply</b> \u2014 think in sets, not loops; every query is a pipeline with a fixed evaluation order \u2014 and reference the rest. Along the way you <b>build the shipyard&#39;s container</b> in the sidebar as you complete parts. Quizzes earn XP. Ranks go from <b>Swabbie</b> to <b>Harbor Master</b>. Finish all 14 parts and the shipyard ships your container.',
